    <item>
      <title>0.19.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 22:27:26 +0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>0.19.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>First public release.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The notch replaces the macOS volume and brightness bezel with one readout — or sits alongside it, if you prefer both.</li>
          <li>On-device dictation: Apple's engine for everyday speech, an optional Whisper model for ~99 languages including Indonesian.</li>
          <li>A visual clipboard history you can search, pin, and paste back anywhere.</li>
          <li>Fast screen capture on ⌘⇧3/4/5, straight into Quick Access — no floating thumbnail.</li>
          <li>A live companion for Claude Code and Codex: watch each step, approve tool calls, and answer its questions in the notch.</li>
          <li>Focus timers, app blocking, a file shelf, and now-playing controls.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Everything runs on your Mac. Your voice, clipboard, screenshots, and agent transcripts are never uploaded.</p>
      ]]></description>
